  {
   "slug": "home",
   "title": "Home",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"fz-section fz-services\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group fz-section fz-services\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"fz-kicker\"} --><p class=\"fz-kicker\">What we do</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Four ways we make things pop</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"fz-emoji\"} --><p class=\"fz-emoji\">✦</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Brand identity</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Names, logos, colour and voice that people remember.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"fz-emoji\"} --><p class=\"fz-emoji\">✸</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Digital products</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Apps and websites that feel friendly from the first tap.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"fz-emoji\"} --><p class=\"fz-emoji\">✺</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Campaigns</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Billboards, films and social posts with a big idea.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"fz-emoji\"} --><p class=\"fz-emoji\">✿</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Packaging</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Boxes and bags that jump off a crowded shelf.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"fz-marquee\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull fz-marquee\"><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Pebble</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Sprout</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Crunchlings</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>City Library</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Fizzfest</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Pebble</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Sprout</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Crunchlings</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>City Library</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Fizzfest</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"fz-section\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group fz-section\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"fz-kicker\"} --><p class=\"fz-kicker\">In numbers</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Small team, big colours</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"fz-stats\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group fz-stats\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>9</strong> years of making things</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>120+</strong> projects shipped</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>14</strong> people in the studio</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>3</strong> studio dogs</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"fz-section fz-team\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group fz-section fz-team\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"fz-kicker\"} --><p class=\"fz-kicker\">The crew</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Meet the people behind the fizz</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-ines}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Ines on a pink background\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ines</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Creative Director</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-tomas}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Tomás on a mint background\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tomás</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Design Lead</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-noor}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Noor on a yellow background\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Noor</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Strategy</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-arlo}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Arlo on a sky blue background\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Arlo</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Developer</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"fz-section fz-quotes\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group fz-section fz-quotes\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"fz-kicker\"} --><p class=\"fz-kicker\">Kind words</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Clients say nice things</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>They made our savings app feel like a hug. Our customers noticed on day one.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Product lead, Pebble</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Six weeks, one launch, zero drama. I would hire them again tomorrow.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Co-founder, Sprout</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Kids now ask for the beetroot ones. That is a sentence I never expected to say.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Marketing, Crunchlings</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"fz-band\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull fz-band\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Got a project that needs a little fizz?</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tell us what you are making. We reply within a day, usually with too many ideas.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Start a project</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:work}}\">See our work</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
   "featured_media": "hero-fizz",
