  {
   "slug": "about",
   "title": "About us",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Fizzwick is an independent brand and digital studio. We started in 2017 with two desks above a bike shop and a belief that design should make people smile before it makes them think.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Today we are fourteen people (and three dogs) working with start-ups, cultural institutions and food brands who are brave enough to be colourful.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we believe</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Joy is a serious business tool.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>The best ideas survive a five-minute sketch.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Clients are collaborators, not audiences.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Every project deserves a launch party.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"fz-team\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns fz-team\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-ines}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Ines on a pink background\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Ines</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-tomas}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Tomás on a mint background\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Tomás</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-noor}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Noor on a yellow background\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Noor</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-arlo}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Arlo on a sky blue background\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Arlo</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->",
   "featured_media": "studio-office"
  },
  {
   "slug": "services",
   "title": "Services",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Every project is different, but most of them start with one of these. Prices are fixed per phase and agreed before we start.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:table --><figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Typical length</th><th>From</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Brand sprint</td><td>1 week</td><td>€6,000</td></tr><tr><td>Brand identity</td><td>6–10 weeks</td><td>€24,000</td></tr><tr><td>Product design</td><td>8–16 weeks</td><td>€32,000</td></tr><tr><td>Campaign</td><td>4–8 weeks</td><td>€18,000</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><!-- /wp:table --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Ask for a proposal</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons -->",
   "parent": "about"
  },
  {
   "slug": "contact",
   "title": "Say hello",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We love a good brief, and an unfinished one even more. Tell us about your project and we will get back to you within one working day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">New projects</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"mailto:hello@example.com\">hello@example.com</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Jobs</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"mailto:jobs@example.com\">jobs@example.com</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Visit</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The yellow door, 12 Canal Street. Coffee is on us.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->"
  }
