 "posts": [
  {
   "slug": "pebble-rebrand",
   "title": "Pebble: a bank that smiles back",
   "date": "2026-10-06T10:00:00",
   "excerpt": "How we helped a savings app swap grey corporate blue for a wordmark you want to squeeze.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Pebble helps people put away small amounts of money every day. Their old brand looked like every other bank: navy, serious and a little bit scary. Their customers were mostly people saving for the first time.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The brief, in one line</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Make saving feel like a game you are winning, without ever feeling childish about money.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:pebble-rebrand}}\" alt=\"The word Pebble in a pink blob shape on cream\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The new Pebble wordmark</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We drew a soft, rounded wordmark that sits inside a pebble shape which slowly changes as your savings grow. The palette went from one blue to five friendly colours, each tied to a savings goal.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A wordmark and a living logo shape</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Five goal colours and an illustration kit</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>App onboarding copy written with their support team</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Launch film and social templates</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our app store rating went from 3.9 to 4.7 in two months. People screenshot their pebble.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Head of Product, Pebble</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote -->",
   "categories": [
    "branding"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "identity",
    "fintech"
   ],
   "featured_media": "pebble-rebrand",
   "format": "standard",
   "sticky": true,
   "comments": [
    {
     "author": "Maya",
     "email": "maya@example.com",
     "content": "The growing pebble is such a lovely idea. I want one for my own savings!",
     "date": "2026-10-06T16:00:00"
    },
    {
     "author": "Fizzwick",
     "email": "hello@example.com",
     "content": "Thank you Maya! It grows a little bit every week.",
     "date": "2026-10-06T19:00:00"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slug": "sprout-app-launch",
   "title": "Launching Sprout in six weeks",
   "date": "2026-09-12T14:30:00",
   "excerpt": "A plant-care app, a tiny team and a launch date that could not move.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Sprout reminds you to water your plants and tells you why they look sad. The founders came to us with a working prototype, a launch date six weeks away and no visual identity at all.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We worked in one-week loops: design on Monday, test with real plant owners on Thursday, ship on Friday. Every week the app got friendlier and the reviews from testers got longer.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Week 1–2</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Name check, colour system, the first five screens.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Week 3–4</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Illustrations for forty plant moods, onboarding, notifications.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Week 5–6</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>App store pages, launch site, a very small party.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Sprout launched on time and reached the top ten in its category in the first week. The plants are doing well too.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "categories": [
    "digital"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "product",
    "launch"
   ],
   "featured_media": "app-launch",
   "format": "standard",
   "sticky": false,
   "comments": []
  },
  {
   "slug": "crunchlings-packaging",
   "title": "Crunchlings: snacks with a face",
   "date": "2026-08-21T09:45:00",
   "excerpt": "Packaging that stands out on a crowded shelf, and makes kids ask for the vegetables.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Crunchlings are baked vegetable snacks. The product was great; the old bag was beige and invisible. Parents liked the ingredients, but children walked straight past.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We gave every flavour a character and a colour, built the boxes so the faces line up when they stand side by side, and moved the ingredient list to the front where parents look first.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:snack-packaging}}\" alt=\"Three colourful snack boxes in violet, pink and mint\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The Crunchlings range</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:pullquote --><figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote\"><blockquote><p>Sales in the first quarter doubled, and the beetroot flavour is now the favourite.</p></blockquote></figure><!-- /wp:pullquote --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Next up: a recyclable pouch that keeps the same faces.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "categories": [
    "packaging",
    "branding"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "food",
    "illustration"
   ],
   "featured_media": "snack-packaging",
   "format": "standard",
   "sticky": false,
   "comments": []
  },
  {
   "slug": "say-hi-library-campaign",
   "title": "Say hi: a campaign for the city library",
   "date": "2026-07-08T11:00:00",
   "excerpt": "Forty billboards, two words and a city that suddenly remembered it has a library.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The city library had a problem: people thought it was only for books. In reality it has a recording studio, sewing machines, a games room and free coffee. Nobody knew.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our campaign used the friendliest greeting we could think of. Every billboard said hi from a different corner of the library, with one short line about what you can do there.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Say hi to a 3D printer.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Say hi to a quiet room with a view.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Say hi to your next favourite board game.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Membership sign-ups rose by a third during the campaign, and the sewing machines now need a booking system.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "categories": [
    "campaigns"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "public",
    "outdoor"
   ],
   "featured_media": "city-campaign",
   "format": "standard",
   "sticky": false,
   "comments": []
  },
  {
   "slug": "fizzfest-identity",
   "title": "Fizzfest '26",
   "date": "2026-05-30T18:20:00",
   "excerpt": "An identity for a three-day music and arts festival that had to work on wristbands and on a forty-metre stage.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Fizzfest is a small festival with big ambitions. They wanted an identity that felt like the first evening of summer: warm, loud and slightly chaotic, but still easy to find your way around.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We built everything from a rainbow arc and a confetti pattern. The arc frames the stage, the gates and the app; the confetti changes colour for each day of the festival.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":2,\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped alignwide\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:festival-identity}}\" alt=\"A rainbow arc under the words Fizzfest 26 with confetti\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Main stage</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:hero-fizz}}\" alt=\"A smiling yellow blob on a pink and violet gradient with confetti\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Social posts</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --></figure><!-- /wp:gallery --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The wayfinding signs were painted by hand by a local sign painter, which is still the best decision we made.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "categories": [
    "branding",
    "campaigns"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "events",
    "identity"
   ],
   "featured_media": "festival-identity",
   "format": "standard",
   "sticky": false,
   "comments": []
  },
  {
   "slug": "how-we-run-a-design-sprint",
   "title": "How we run a five-day design sprint",
   "date": "2026-04-15T09:00:00",
   "excerpt": "Our slightly unusual sprint recipe, including the snacks.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We run a sprint at the start of almost every project. It is the fastest way to get everyone in one room, agree on the problem and leave with something real to test.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The recipe</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Monday: map the problem, pick one target.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Tuesday: everyone sketches, alone and together.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Wednesday: decide, with stickers and no long speeches.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Thursday: build a realistic prototype.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Friday: test with five real people.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The most important rule: no laptops on Monday and Tuesday. The second most important rule: good snacks. Hungry people defend bad ideas.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>By Friday we had changed our minds three times, and every change was the right one.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>A client, after their first sprint</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote -->",
   "categories": [
    "studio-notes"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "process"
   ],
   "featured_media": "workshop-sprint",
   "format": "standard",
   "sticky": false,
   "comments": [
    {
     "author": "Sam",
     "email": "sam@example.com",
     "content": "Completely agree on the snacks rule. Stealing this for our next workshop.",
     "date": "2026-04-16T15:00:00"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slug": "our-new-studio",
   "title": "We moved into a yellow studio",
   "date": "2026-02-20T16:00:00",
   "excerpt": "Bigger windows, a proper kitchen and a wall we are allowed to paint.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>After four years above a bike shop we finally have a studio with enough desks for everyone and a meeting room that is not also the kitchen.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We painted one wall bright yellow on the first day. The landlord was surprisingly happy about it. There are plants on every surface, mostly kept alive with the help of an app we designed.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:studio-office}}\" alt=\"A desk with a violet screen and a plant in a sunny studio\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The new studio</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Come and visit. We have good coffee and very strong opinions about biscuits.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "categories": [
    "studio-notes"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "studio"
   ],
   "featured_media": "studio-office",
